1
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,160
Miss Bai,

2
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:43,430
are you busy?

3
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:46,120
Auntie, are you going out?

4
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:48,120
Tomorrow is the Qiqiao Festival.

5
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:50,990
I embroidered some sachets to sell at the market.

6
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:55,330
Qiqiao Festival?

7
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:57,200
Yes.

8
00:00:57,330 --> 00:00:58,930
I tell you, it's very lively.

9
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:00,700
It's a festival for lovers.

10
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
You two

11
00:01:02,130 --> 00:01:03,460
must have plans, right?

12
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:07,300
We...

13
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:08,630
Never mind.

14
00:01:08,630 --> 00:01:09,700
I have to go.

15
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:12,160
If I'm late, I won't be able to sell them all.

16
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:17,600
Qiqiao Festival.

17
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:20,960
Qiqiao Festival.

18
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:23,520
He has taken care of me for so long.

19
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:26,260
This time, I want to do something for him too.

20
00:01:27,530 --> 00:01:27,860
Meat,

21
00:01:29,130 --> 00:01:29,530
noodles,

22
00:01:29,530 --> 00:01:30,260
vegetables,

23
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,800
and another trip to the tailor shop.

24
00:01:36,360 --> 00:01:37,490
It should be enough.

25
00:01:37,930 --> 00:01:39,660
I have to get up early tomorrow.

26
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:40,300
This is my first time giving someone a gift.

27
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:40,700
You...

28
00:02:40,930 --> 00:02:42,790
you are not allowed to dislike it.

29
00:02:50,260 --> 00:02:51,600
Why isn't he back yet?

30
00:02:53,300 --> 00:02:54,100
My wife, look.

31
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,329
They bloomed by the river.

32
00:02:55,329 --> 00:02:56,790
I picked a handful for you.

33
00:02:59,630 --> 00:03:00,760
What are you waiting for?

34
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:01,500
Try it on.

35
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:02,630
My wife,

36
00:03:02,930 --> 00:03:03,500
did you

37
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:05,000
make these?

38
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,260
Otherwise?

39
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:09,490
Could they appear out of thin air?

40
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,160
Are these clothes

41
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,030
for me too?

42
00:03:21,530 --> 00:03:23,800
If you don't like them, give them back to me.

43
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,800
I like them.

44
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,000
Given by my wife,

45
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,400
how could I not like them?

46
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:28,860
I'll go change into them right now.

47
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:29,990
Wait for me, my wife.

48
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,800
Three hundred years.

49
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,660
I've finally waited until today.

50
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,500
She cooked a table of dishes for me

51
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:40,860
and picked out new clothes for me.

52
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:41,990
What does this mean?

53
00:03:42,130 --> 00:03:42,790
It means...

54
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:53,930
I knew it.

55
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:00,960
My hard times are over.

56
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,690
What's going on?

57
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:11,320
My Lord,

58
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,960
the Heavenly Emperor's army is approaching.

59
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,260
They have broken through three cities.

60
00:04:14,260 --> 00:04:15,860
Our brothers fought to the death to stop them for two days,

61
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:16,329
and more than half are dead or injured.

62
00:04:16,329 --> 00:04:17,589
The Heavenly Emperor.

63
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:21,430
It seems Zhaohan must know something.

64
00:04:21,829 --> 00:04:23,200
The commander went into battle himself

65
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:24,660
and is trapped in Luoxing Valley.

66
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:26,700
He ordered me to fight my way out to report.

67
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:27,760
If no one takes charge,

68
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:29,360
the Demon Realm is finished.

69
00:04:45,030 --> 00:04:45,460
Baili,

70
00:04:45,860 --> 00:04:47,190
wait for me to come back.

71
00:04:49,130 --> 00:04:50,100
Are you dressed yet?

72
00:04:50,100 --> 00:04:52,560
You've been dawdling over a robe for so long.

73
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:55,860
Cangyuan.

74
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:17,160
Liar.
